    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just exhaustion. it's that even if i stopped performing, the world wouldn't change, it would just be me failing everyone. there is no room for me to breathe here. sometimes i think the only way to truly be free, to actually have control over something, is to just... leave. to just exit the whole thing so the weight finally stops.",
