      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "If you are feeling like the weight is too much and you are having thoughts of harming yourself, please know that there are people who want to support you right now. You can connect with compassionate and trained individuals by calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada, or by calling 111 in the UK. These services are free, confidential, and available 24/7 to help you through this crisis. Please reach out to them immediately.",
      "source": "target",
